cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "BayesTS Studio"
abstract: >-
  A desktop application for Bayesian vector autoregressive and vector error
  correction models along the bvartools workflow: data, model, priors,
  posterior draws and their application, without writing code. Impulse
  responses, variance decompositions, sign and zero restrictions, historical
  decompositions, spillovers and dynamic multipliers, for constant and
  time-varying models. All estimation is done by BayesTS.
